~ start
Danilo: Huh... it started raining.  
Danilo: I knew it would. 
Danilo: Even thunder, just as I expected.  
Danilo: There’s nowhere to take cover right now.  
Danilo: I’ll stay at the chapel for now.  
Danilo: I have to go back to the old chapel.  
do Hud.show_objectives()
=> END

~ back_to_chapel_again
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]Back here again...[/shake]  
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]I didn’t really have a choice...[/shake]  
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]The pages will get soaked if I leave them.[/shake]  
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]I just hope... I don’t see what I saw earlier...[/shake]  
=> END


~ light_candle
Danilo: I have to light all the candles again...  
=> END

~ after_arrange_pages
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]I’m terrified[/shake] of what I might discover... but even more [shake rate=20 level=10]terrified[/shake] of what I might miss.  
Danilo: Should I really continue this?  
Danilo: Whatever I’m about to read... I just hope I can handle it.
=> END
